# Delta set 3: reruns of set 2. Base: ubuntu-24.04.5-server-base1.
# slapd-d1 failed on a phased update (fixed in bl-apt.sh); wsdd's daemon is
# in wsdd-server on Ubuntu (wsdd-d2 installed only the script).
